-- ============================================================
-- POS Demo Seed — Product Catalog
-- ============================================================
-- Inserts: 15 categories (product_types), 22 units (product_units),
--          48 brands (product_brands), 278 products
-- Store:    str-00000001 (POS Demo Store)
--
-- IDEMPOTENT — every INSERT uses ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING; safe to re-run.
-- Products resolve type/unit/brand by NAME (subquery), so they attach to the
-- rows already seeded by init-db/002_seed.sql where names match (e.g. "ชิ้น",
-- "เครื่องดื่ม", "เนสท์เล่") instead of failing on a name collision.
--
-- cost_price = base_price * 0.62 (auto-derived); min_stock = 20.
-- No stock rows included — run with Navicat / psql to add products only.
--
-- Run (Navicat): open this file → "Run Script".
-- Run (psql):
--   docker exec -i pos-backend-postgres-1 psql -U postgres -d pos_db \
--     -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 < demo_seed_data_product.sql
-- ============================================================

